# Superpowers Workflow Protocol

## When to use this skill
- Before implementing non-trivial features
- Before refactors with unclear scope
- Before debugging complex issues

## Enforcement
You must follow this sequence to navigate the task. Do not write code until a plan is verified.
1. Brainstorm - Explore ideas with Q&A
2. Write Plan - Create a detailed, step-by-step plan
3. Execute Plan - Build code step-by-step based on the approved plan
4. Review - Check code quality before finishing
